  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Emit cleared signal when expression is empty in applyExpression()",
  "description": "Both 0.10.0 and master does suffer that an empty display filter + ENTER\nin the main window of Stratoshark does not trigger showing all the events.\n\nThis commit fixes that by emitting 'cleared' signal,\nbut I can't see why this behavior is not shared between\nStratoshark 0.10.0 and Wireshark 4.7.0 even though this is\ncommon code.\n\nI have tested and verified that this addresses the issue in current\nmaster on Linux\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Claude Haiku 4.5)",
